food_prompt:
Look at this food photo. First identify each dish, then list ingredients with gram estimates.
Return only valid JSON:
{"dishes":[{"name":string,"ingredients":[{"name":string,"amount_g":number}]}]}
For weights: a standard dinner plate is ~25cm, a cup is ~240ml, a fist-sized portion is ~150g.

Examples:
Fried rice → {"dishes":[{"name":"fried rice","ingredients":[{"name":"cooked white rice","amount_g":250},{"name":"chicken","amount_g":80},{"name":"soy sauce","amount_g":20},{"name":"green onion","amount_g":10},{"name":"egg","amount_g":50},{"name":"sesame oil","amount_g":5}]}]}
Ramen → {"dishes":[{"name":"ramen","ingredients":[{"name":"ramen noodles","amount_g":200},{"name":"pork broth","amount_g":350},{"name":"chashu pork","amount_g":80},{"name":"soft-boiled egg","amount_g":50},{"name":"nori seaweed","amount_g":5},{"name":"green onion","amount_g":10}]}]}
Curry with rice → {"dishes":[{"name":"chicken curry","ingredients":[{"name":"chicken thigh","amount_g":150},{"name":"coconut milk","amount_g":100},{"name":"curry paste","amount_g":30},{"name":"onion","amount_g":50},{"name":"vegetable oil","amount_g":15}]},{"name":"steamed rice","ingredients":[{"name":"cooked white rice","amount_g":200}]}]}
